sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Staff as Staff / Customer
  participant Payment as Payment<br/>settlement service
  participant Order as Order<br/>bill owner
  participant PDB as PostgreSQL<br/>Payment DB

  Staff->>Payment: Create VietQR or confirm cash
  Payment->>Order: BILL_GET_PAYMENT_SNAPSHOT

  alt Bill is payable
    Order-->>Payment: Status + VND rounding snapshot
    Payment->>Payment: Validate VND rounding snapshot

    alt VietQR request
      Payment->>PDB: Create or reuse PENDING intent
      Payment-->>Staff: QR URL + rounded amount
    else Cash confirmation
      Payment->>PDB: Lock or create payment row
      Payment-->>Staff: Ready for cash commit
    end
  else Bill is invalid
    Order-->>Payment: Not payable or invalid snapshot
    Payment-->>Staff: Reject before Payment DB mutation
  end

  Note over Payment,PDB: Payment mutates its DB only after Order confirms the payable bill snapshot
